WEBVTT

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:06.751
Used well, AI helps you learn and work faster. Used badly, it stops you learning.

00:00:07.600 --> 00:00:13.501
Ask AI to explain a hard topic in simpler words, or with a local example.

00:00:14.050 --> 00:00:16.968
Ask for practice questions, then answer them yourself.

00:00:17.520 --> 00:00:23.189
At work, let it draft an email or a report, then edit it in your own voice.

00:00:23.740 --> 00:00:27.946
Copying AI answers as your own work is cheating, and you learn nothing.

00:00:28.500 --> 00:00:33.122
You are responsible for everything you send. Read it, check it, and make it yours.

00:00:33.670 --> 00:00:44.990
Before you move on, check: Use AI to explain one topic you find hard. Make practice questions and answer them yourself. Edit an AI draft into your own words.

00:00:45.740 --> 00:00:48.820
In the next lesson: Privacy and safety.
